    "created_at": "2016-03-10T22:14:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-10T22:14:12Z",
    "body": "Do you have a test case showing that this doesn't match what is implemented in browsers?\n\nWhen trying to test this I fail to nagivate an iframe (by changing `src` or `contentWindow.location.href`) that is not the same origin as the outer document, even if I set `document.domain` on both.\n",
