    "created_at": "2016-03-11T09:01:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-11T09:01:15Z",
    "body": "Yes, it could have a note that points to navigating. Do you want to take a stab at a PR? :-)\n\nChanging the normative text seems scary if there isn't a known security issue to fix.\n",
